SOAPBOX: K3CCR is the club station at the Collington continuing-care
SOAPBOX: retirement community at FM 18OW in MD, just east of DC. For the
SOAPBOX: 2025 CQ WW CW, I (N3UM) was the only CW op. I did SOHP Assisted. I
SOAPBOX: hoped to ~match the 1.57 M score I claimed in 2024 SFI was a bit
SOAPBOX: down & Kp a bit up from last year. At start, I did OK on 40 M 240
SOAPBOX: Qs 00-04Z, 60/hr. On 20 M 0410-0422Z I got 11 Qs in 12 min. That
SOAPBOX: cleared the band map so, I quit to sleep with 16 fewer Qs than
SOAPBOX: last year, to return early. Good idea back on 20 M 1224-1311Z I
SOAPBOX: got 50 Qs, 66/hr. Then on 15 M 1314-1419 I got 78 Qs, 72/hr. On 10
SOAPBOX: M 1428-1603Z I got 102 Qs, 64/hr. Got 22 more 15-M Qs 1605-1625Z,
SOAPBOX: & quit for lunch with 53 more total Qs than at 1635Z in ’24. Back
SOAPBOX: at 1839Z I got 27 15-M Qs by 1913Z, then 115 20-M Qs 1914-2139Z
SOAPBOX: and 26 40-M Qs 2152-2222Z and quit for supper, 95 Qs ahead of that
SOAPBOX: time in ’24. Back 0027-0257Z I got 101 40-M Qs, 40/hr, then 69 80-
SOAPBOX: M Qs 0323-0446Z low bands slow with Kp=4 00-06Z. At 0446Z QRT +81
SOAPBOX: Qs re 2024. Back on 20 M 1305-1334Z I got 30 Qs in 29 min, on 15 M
SOAPBOX: 1338-1424Z 36 Qs in 39 min, & on 10 M 1431-1510Z 36 Qs. But, after
SOAPBOX: ~15Z, NO spots from W3LPL or W9PA. Telnet OK I tried reconnects &
SOAPBOX: waiting. Nope BIG problem. I tried S&P on 10 M 1545-1628Z & got
SOAPBOX: just 13 Qs noisy and slow. I quit to eat. Back at 1923Z, still no
SOAPBOX: spots. S&P for 18 15-M Qs by 2021Z, then ran for 20 of 21 20-M Qs
SOAPBOX: 2034-2122Z then spots came back. I clicked 9 20-M Qs in 6 mins,
SOAPBOX: but few sigs on the bandmap. On 40 M from 2136Z I clicked for 73
SOAPBOX: Qs at 26/hr, then QRT. I had 1088 Qs, only 27 below my 1115 Qs in
SOAPBOX: 2024. BUT, I had 47 fewer total mults than in 2024 +32 on 80 & 40
SOAPBOX: M, but -79 on 20 thru 10 M! Spots are vital to get mults fast. So,
SOAPBOX: no spots for ~6.2 hrs in daylight 1500-2122Z ruined my 2025 score.
